SUMMARY:StepUp Walking Challenge
DESCRIPTION:Join our StepUp Walking Challenge and take steps to better health\, teamwork\, and a little friendly competition! Staff and Faculty are encouraged to form teams and track their daily steps throughout the challenge. Whether you take a quick stroll during lunch or set out on a hike\, every step counts toward you team's total. The team with the highest step count at the end of the challenge will be eligible for a prize! This is great opportunity to increase physical activity\, support workplace wellness\, and connect with colleagues toward a common goal. In order to participate please download the StepUp App on Apple or Android. A QR code for app information has been included on the flyer. Lace up your shoes\, gather your teams and StepUp to the challenge July 13-20.
LOCATION:Online
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/0f455cb7-d695-4e31-8214-af4e125ba25231a785e7-0df1-407e-a980-fe11b2503170.png
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:12500773@fairmontstate.edu
DTSTAMP:20260718T140000Z
DTSTART:20260718T140000Z
DTEND:20260718T200000Z
SUMMARY:Car Wash
DESCRIPTION:Help Send Fairmont State Cheer to Daytona! The Fairmont State Cheer Team is hosting a Car Wash Fundraiser to help us cover expenses for our upcoming competition in Daytona this April\, as well as other costs throughout our season. Swing by for a freshly washed car\, support your local cheer team\, and help us represent Fairmont State on the national stage! Every donation and every car washed brings us one step closer to our goals. Clean car. Great cause. Big dreams. Thank you for supporting Fairmont State Cheer. We can't wait to see you there!
LOCATION:Advance Auto Parts\, 917 Morgantown Ave\, fairmont\, WV
URL:https://static.campuslabsengage.com/discovery/images/events/fundraising.jpg
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
