SUMMARY:Fairmont State Alumni - Charleston\, SC Chapter Social
DESCRIPTION:Fairmont State alumna Lauren OBrien of the Charleston\, SC Alumni Chapter reached out yesterday afternoon with exciting news about a chapter event she is facilitating! Lauren is a project designer with the K-12 Practice Area at McMillian Pazdan Smith Architecture\, and was featured on the Falcons Beyond the Classroom Podcast in 2025. If you are in the Charleston\, SC area on July 18\, 2026\, please plan to join Lauren and fellow Fairmont State alumni and friends at Snafu Brewing! Fairmont State Alumni - Charleston\, SC Chapter Social 4:006:00 p.m. Snafu Brewing 3280 Industry Drive North Charleston\, SC 29418 (843) 767-4121 info@snafubrewingcompany.com Kindly RSVP by July 10\, 2026\, by emailing alumni@fairmontstate.edu. We hope many Falcons will be able to attend as we continue to grow alumni connections in the Charleston\, SC area!
LOCATION:Snafu Brewing\, 3280 Industry Drive\, North Charleston\, SC 29418
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/b89a7f70-3e5a-4723-ab46-ae9f7ede722e6892b212-2450-478c-8fa6-4ea073bf2793.png
END:VEVENT
