SUMMARY:New Faculty Orientation
DESCRIPTION:Join us for New Faculty Orientation\, a welcoming and informative introduction to Fairmont State University. This session is designed to help new faculty transition successfully into their roles by connecting them with key campus resources\, introducing essential policies and procedures\, and providing guidance on course development and teaching expectations. Participants will also have the opportunity to meet colleagues\, engage with Academic Affairs leadership\, and begin building a strong foundation for success in teaching\, scholarship\, and service.
LOCATION:Jaynes Hall 117\, 1201 Locust Avenue\, Fairmont\, WV
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/47c5803e-ab69-4d11-a44b-d71262a5a816e5189b4a-ca5e-4585-9109-9ea8a07cfe4f.png
