SUMMARY:Convocation 
DESCRIPTION:After you meet up with your group at 8:30\, head together to the Feaster Center for Convocation. First Year Students this is your official welcome to Fairmont State! University leadership\, including the President\, will welcome you and get your academic career started on the right foot. You'll take a class photo and sign the pledge to graduate banner! After convocation\, stick with your group leader and walk together with your group to the Educational Sessions at 10:30.
