DESCRIPTION:On Saturday morning you have two options to get off campus and see more of Fairmont! Option 2: Join campus celebrities Amie Fazalare and Susan Rodriguez for a bus tour (with stops to explore) of the sights of Fairmont! You'll end downtown with the option to stay for the Tomato Festival\, an event co-hosted by the City of Fairmont and Fairmont State. Open to new and returning students. Spaces are limited! Meet at Bryant Place Loop. New students: Be sure you are back to campus for lunch and your Group check in at 1:15pm!
